q: title: Will a dildo be thrown onto the court at a WNBA game on Saturday?, description: This market will resolve to "Yes" if a dildo is thrown onto the court during a WNBA game on the listed date (ET). Otherwise, it will resolve to "No".

A qualifying object is exclusively a dildo, defined as an object shaped like an erect penis used for sexual stimulation. Other sex toys will not qualify.

The resolution source will be a consensus of credible reporting. market_id: 572996 res_data: p1: 0, p2: 1, p3: 0.5. Where p1 corresponds to No, p2 to Yes, p3 to unknown/50-50. Updates made by the question creator via the bulletin board at 0x157Ce2d672854c848c9b79C49a8Cc6cc89176a49 as described by https://polygonscan.com/tx/0xa14f01b115c4913624fc3f508f960f4dea252758e73c28f5f07f8e19d7bca066 should be considered.,initializer:91430cad2d3975766499717fa0d66a78d814e5c5,ooRequester:157ce2d672854c848c9b79c49a8cc6cc89176a49